# 1989shack (GitHub Pages site)

This repository contains a small static site to be hosted on GitHub Pages. It uses plain HTML/CSS/JS.

Files:
- `index.html` — main page
Deployment steps summarized (quick):

Create repo named 1989shack.github.io (recommended) or any repo and enable Pages from main branch.
Commit & push the files above.
Add DNS records at your registrar:
A records (apex): 185.199.108.153, 185.199.109.153, 185.199.110.153, 185.199.111.153
CNAME for www → 1989shack.github.io
Ensure the CNAME file contains "1989shack.com" (already included).
Wait for propagation; GitHub will provide TLS.
